      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِدَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَدَ</span></b> , (O, L, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْدٌ</span> (O, L,
